Server init.

>> x := Blob novo: 65 tipo: ['char'].
# for this test you need set a path to libc (puts)
>> libname := Programa configurar: ['FFITESTLIB'].
Server ligar: (
 Listar novo ;
 libname ;
 ['putchar'] ;
 ( Listar novo ; ['char'] ) ;
 ['void'] ;
 ['Print'] ;
 ['char:']
).
Print char: (x de: 0 comprimento: 1), stop.
x livre.

